{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Game Introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sexorcism is a casual RPG centered around the theme of demonic exorcism.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mysterious girl fights back against monsters with her powerful magic. Facing an endless onslaught, her mana is on the verge of depletion when you arrive in her moment of crisis. As the male protagonist, you will use your unique ability\u2014restoring her mana with your semen\u2014to save her from her plight and reverse her fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>\u25c6 Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique game mode combining classic slot machine mechanics with magic and monster-slaying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sexorcism fuses slot machine elements to make every action random and exciting. You must decide how to allocate your mana to the spells on the board. With each spin, the final spell to be cast is determined, and its damage is multiplied based on the mana you invested. After each victory, you'll have a chance to randomly acquire more powerful skills or new abilities, ensuring every playthrough is full of surprises.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c7 Satisfying and impactful combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455020/extras/d522909e764b89c3a3c55313de32e2c6.poster.avif?t=1770778390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455020/extras/d522909e764b89c3a3c55313de32e2c6.webm?t=1770778390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455020/extras/d522909e764b89c3a3c55313de32e2c6.mp4?t=1770778390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7 Vivid Live2D animation and dynamic camera work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455020/extras/5a5b5777145bf859cfee690d93e5dcfa.poster.avif?t=1770778390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455020/extras/5a5b5777145bf859cfee690d93e5dcfa.webm?t=1770778390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455020/extras/5a5b5777145bf859cfee690d93e5dcfa.mp4?t=1770778390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7 Interact freely with Ely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455020/extras/6ef3188da74f80422845cceb42464a28.poster.avif?t=1770778390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455020/extras/6ef3188da74f80422845cceb42464a28.webm?t=1770778390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455020/extras/6ef3188da74f80422845cceb42464a28.mp4?t=1770778390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7 After a short rest, the adventure continues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455020/extras/3d94ae593cdd34c971ace83618e1c0bd.poster.avif?t=1770778390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455020